
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# Build / distribution
dist/
build/

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp